  "solution": {
    "text": "We have <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, <math><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mro